title Cassette WAV with a 24-character name with spaces (Morning walk with my dog): the info box beside the counter shows the codec (WAV 48k) and the time left, never the name; the label holds only the name, up to two lines, no SIDE A, no codec text
sizes 480x480
ppmm 667
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODEC wav
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NAME "Morning walk with my dog"
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LEFT "955 h"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot name-wav-sq480
expect esc
expect text "WAV 48k"
expect text "955 h left"
expect notext "TAKE 007"
expect notext "SIDE A"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
